WEBVTT

00:10.885 --> 00:12.429
BASED ON THE KINGDOM OF THE GODS BY YLAB

00:12.512 --> 00:14.639
[opening theme music]

01:10.945 --> 01:12.155
[snarls]

01:33.635 --> 01:36.429
SCHOLARLY INSTITUTION
NEAR THE CITADEL OF HANYANG

01:46.815 --> 01:47.941
When dawn hits...

01:50.777 --> 01:52.904
all of your families will be executed.

01:54.531 --> 01:56.199
The bureau will make sure of it.

02:03.998 --> 02:05.792
Because of your service to me.

02:07.752 --> 02:09.879
Will you remain loyal with that knowledge?

02:11.047 --> 02:12.507
Everything is at risk.

02:15.426 --> 02:17.137
Can you continue to fight?

02:25.770 --> 02:27.772
[foreboding music]

02:39.951 --> 02:41.202
PATIENT JOURNAL

02:49.711 --> 02:52.046
[indistinct chatter]

02:55.216 --> 02:56.759
[child whimpering]

02:56.843 --> 02:59.846
Please! Let him go! Stop it!

03:00.180 --> 03:01.181
[officer] Get back!

03:01.931 --> 03:03.099
[woman 1] No!

03:03.183 --> 03:05.768
[sobbing, wailing]

03:07.562 --> 03:08.646
[woman 2] Please...

03:09.355 --> 03:12.442
I don't wanna go,
I don't wanna go, please

03:12.525 --> 03:14.194
[crying]
Father!

03:16.237 --> 03:18.698
[muffled crying]

03:21.951 --> 03:23.828
[tense music]

03:42.472 --> 03:43.389
Put me down.

03:48.895 --> 03:51.522
[man 1] This country
has already suffered much.

03:51.606 --> 03:53.775
Cho Hak-ju's death was only the latest.

03:53.858 --> 03:55.944
We should postpone the executions.

03:56.027 --> 03:57.737
Her Majesty made it very clear

03:57.820 --> 04:00.114
these executions
must be carried out on time.

04:00.198 --> 04:02.283
The Minister of War has a point.

04:02.784 --> 04:05.662
Some of the soldiers' families
are of noble origin.

04:06.704 --> 04:08.665
These executions should wait

04:08.748 --> 04:11.125
until we know the truth behind this.

04:11.542 --> 04:14.212
This order has come straight
from Her Majesty.

04:14.879 --> 04:16.506
This is a royal command.

04:16.923 --> 04:18.883
[man 2] Sir, please step outside
for a moment.

04:24.597 --> 04:25.807
What on earth is going on here?

04:27.058 --> 04:28.643
I am here to make a confession.

04:29.936 --> 04:31.312
The traitor, Prince Chang,

04:32.605 --> 04:34.816
and soldiers
from the Military Training Corps

04:35.316 --> 04:38.653
are waiting for backup outside Hanyang
at Yeonggi Academy.

04:40.071 --> 04:42.198
Now that I've given you
this information...

04:44.117 --> 04:46.452
I ask you to spare my family.

04:47.787 --> 04:49.497
[ominous music]

05:02.802 --> 05:05.388
It seems as though my father was correct.

05:09.892 --> 05:11.311
Chang is a traitor.

05:12.312 --> 05:14.856
With every move, he digs his own grave.

05:23.072 --> 05:25.241
[tense music]

05:27.785 --> 05:28.619
[guard 1] Fire!

05:39.464 --> 05:41.090
Why aren't there screams?

05:42.759 --> 05:45.011
[inhales deeply]

05:57.648 --> 05:59.025
Oh, it's empty, sir!

05:59.734 --> 06:01.486
[guard 2] There's no one here either.

06:06.199 --> 06:09.077
It must have been a trap
to lure soldiers away from Hanyang.

06:09.577 --> 06:10.703
Those bastards.

06:12.413 --> 06:14.040
SEO YEONG-GO

06:20.338 --> 06:21.714
LEE CHANG

06:28.221 --> 06:30.390
[guard] The Crown Prince is here!

06:30.473 --> 06:32.308
[stirring music]

07:03.965 --> 07:07.301
[guard 2] Gather up the rest of our men!
Seal off the gates!

07:08.469 --> 07:09.345
[man] Yah!

07:10.680 --> 07:12.974
NORTH GATE, CITADEL OF HANYANG

07:38.791 --> 07:40.251
[guard] The Crown Prince is here!

07:40.334 --> 07:41.377
He's at the gate.

07:41.461 --> 07:43.671
How many soldiers do we have left
in the Police Bureau?

07:43.754 --> 07:45.923
Only a few dozen men
left at best, my lord.

07:46.007 --> 07:47.341
Many left with the palace guards.

07:47.425 --> 07:48.718
Assemble the remaining soldiers.

07:48.801 --> 07:51.137
We'll need backup.
Ask the Minister of War for assistance.

07:51.220 --> 07:53.014
[prisoners whimpering, sobbing]

07:53.431 --> 07:54.432
[woman] Please...

07:55.057 --> 07:57.143
Please spare us.

07:57.226 --> 07:59.353
ROYAL COMMANDERY

08:14.076 --> 08:15.745
"Good people of Joseon.

08:16.787 --> 08:19.040
These individuals claim to be loyal,

08:19.582 --> 08:22.293
yet they cannot condemn
the traitor, Chang.

08:22.418 --> 08:23.878
To make matters worse,

08:23.961 --> 08:27.840
they joined hands with our public enemy
in pursuit of their own selfish greed.

08:28.424 --> 08:32.637
Thus, all families of those sympathetic
shall be beheaded when--"

08:32.720 --> 08:35.139
[prisoners sobbing, wailing loudly]

08:36.557 --> 08:38.351
Please, I don't wanna die!

08:45.942 --> 08:47.360
"This is an order.

08:48.110 --> 08:48.945
Beheaded..."

08:49.445 --> 08:50.905
[wailing]

08:53.115 --> 08:54.825
[sobbing inconsolably]

09:03.000 --> 09:04.001
"...shall be..."

09:09.382 --> 09:10.383
[sighs]

09:13.386 --> 09:14.720
I can't do this.

09:15.805 --> 09:17.598
Head of the commandery or not,

09:18.140 --> 09:19.517
nobody should do this.

09:31.821 --> 09:33.823
[gasps]
Your Highness.

09:39.036 --> 09:40.246
Your Highness.

09:43.916 --> 09:45.334
You made the right choice.

09:45.418 --> 09:47.712
Sir, it's you.

09:47.795 --> 09:48.879
Yes.

09:50.131 --> 09:52.300
And I will return to my rightful place.

09:54.427 --> 09:55.720
Will you join with me?

09:57.388 --> 10:00.850
Your Highness,
the Royal Commandery is at your side.

10:07.481 --> 10:09.108
Untie these people now.

10:10.234 --> 10:11.319
They are guilty of nothing!

10:13.237 --> 10:14.822
[relieved chatter]

10:19.827 --> 10:21.078
Give me a sword.

10:22.204 --> 10:23.873
I want to aid you if I can.

10:34.091 --> 10:37.511
Hello, my lord.
The traitors are at the execution site.

10:39.722 --> 10:41.807
My lord, what is the meaning of this?

10:41.891 --> 10:43.851
- Restrain all the guards!
- [officers] Sir!

10:46.729 --> 10:48.856
[foreboding music]

10:51.067 --> 10:53.736
JINSEON GATE

10:53.819 --> 10:55.029
I'm quite confused.

10:55.112 --> 10:57.406
Why is Chang making his way to the palace?

10:57.490 --> 10:59.742
What happened to all the soldiers
we stationed out there?

10:59.825 --> 11:02.203
It appears the majority of them defected,

11:02.286 --> 11:04.080
including our Royal Commandery.

11:07.416 --> 11:08.751
[court lady] The gates are sealed.

11:09.168 --> 11:12.004
Not even the palace guards
are allowed access to the citadel.

11:12.088 --> 11:13.506
[breathing anxiously]

11:16.342 --> 11:17.301
Your Majesty.

11:17.718 --> 11:20.262
We should escape while we still have time.

11:20.346 --> 11:21.764
[ominous music]

11:27.311 --> 11:29.063
I will go to the Main Hall.

11:29.939 --> 11:31.482
I need to prepare...

11:32.733 --> 11:34.318
to welcome my son.

11:35.403 --> 11:36.862
[court lady] Your Majesty...

11:37.446 --> 11:40.074
[tense music]

12:02.972 --> 12:04.974
PATIENT JOURNAL

12:05.057 --> 12:06.308
This cannot be.

12:06.392 --> 12:09.562
That patient journal once belonged
to Doctor Lee Seung-hui,

12:09.645 --> 12:10.813
the former royal physician.

12:10.896 --> 12:13.107
Everything recorded within it is true.

12:14.900 --> 12:16.652
[sighs]
What should I do?

12:17.153 --> 12:18.904
Are you here with an errand
from the Prince?

12:19.613 --> 12:21.741
The Haewon Cho Clan are very dangerous.

12:23.951 --> 12:24.952
His Highness...

12:25.411 --> 12:27.496
will like you to show
that you are different from them.

12:28.914 --> 12:30.374
[sighs forcefully]

12:39.717 --> 12:43.429
We have successfully quelled the soldiers.
The police have been contained.

12:44.221 --> 12:46.474
And now, I will escort you to the palace.

12:54.732 --> 12:57.026
The Crown Prince is on his way
to the palace.

13:02.031 --> 13:03.949
[man] Wait. What does that mean?

13:09.288 --> 13:11.749
The Prince is back?
Did you say he is coming?

13:12.792 --> 13:13.626
Let him out.

13:13.709 --> 13:14.877
[keys jangling]

13:15.961 --> 13:18.214
[key turns, door opens]

13:20.800 --> 13:21.759
It's over.

13:22.218 --> 13:24.303
The Haewon Cho Clan's rule
has come to its end.

13:40.736 --> 13:42.154
[councilor] Highness!

13:42.696 --> 13:44.949
Oh, please spare our lives, sir.

13:45.449 --> 13:48.577
You should understand,
Cho Hak-ju gave us the orders,

13:48.661 --> 13:52.706
told us they were from Her Majesty
and we had no choice but to follow them.

13:52.790 --> 13:56.669
[ministers] Please have mercy on us,
Your Highness.

13:58.337 --> 14:02.174
Highness, we are all so happy
to serve under you from now on.

14:02.258 --> 14:05.761
And to assist you, we have already
disarmed all of the palace guards.

14:07.179 --> 14:08.722
Please, would you like to come inside?

14:08.806 --> 14:10.307
[tense music]

14:53.267 --> 14:54.768
You are finally here.

14:56.896 --> 14:58.647
You've been away for too long.

14:58.731 --> 15:01.317
Come here and pay respect to your mother.

15:02.902 --> 15:04.778
You are not my mother.

15:05.654 --> 15:06.655
[chuckles]

15:09.909 --> 15:12.036
You deny your filial duties?

15:12.745 --> 15:14.038
I'm disappointed.

15:15.080 --> 15:16.540
Give up the throne.

15:17.124 --> 15:19.043
It does not and will never belong to you.

15:19.126 --> 15:23.172
And by doing this, you believe the people
will serve you instead?

15:25.174 --> 15:26.258
They won't.

15:27.384 --> 15:28.510
You're a demon.

15:29.011 --> 15:32.806
A criminal that decapitated his own father
with his bare hands.

15:34.642 --> 15:35.935
This throne belongs...

15:38.479 --> 15:40.564
to my son, the heir to the King.

15:45.152 --> 15:46.403
This child...

15:47.613 --> 15:50.199
how do we know
he truly is the son of the King?

15:50.658 --> 15:52.785
Why were pregnant women
found gathered and buried

15:52.868 --> 15:54.411
outside your manor at Naeseonjae?

15:55.496 --> 15:58.457
What events led to Your Majesty
killing those women and children?

15:59.333 --> 16:01.794
I'm afraid that Minister Ho has a point.

16:02.086 --> 16:04.755
I, too, have been harboring
my own doubts about this.

16:04.838 --> 16:07.508
We must place all of the physicians
and the court ladies

16:07.591 --> 16:08.926
under arrest posthaste,

16:09.009 --> 16:10.678
so the truth of this matter may be found.

16:10.761 --> 16:12.262
You doubt my child?

16:12.888 --> 16:15.349
You dare question
he's the son of the King?

16:15.432 --> 16:17.601
I am here
not because I care for the throne

16:17.685 --> 16:19.687
nor to oust you
for being a member of the clan

16:19.770 --> 16:21.146
that you were simply born into.

16:21.939 --> 16:24.566
The throne has responsibilities
you will never understand!

16:25.275 --> 16:27.695
"The people of this land
regard food as a god,

16:28.570 --> 16:30.739
and the King must serve
his people as such."

16:32.366 --> 16:34.368
You have neglected your responsibility.

16:39.790 --> 16:41.792
[ominous music]

16:42.084 --> 16:43.335
Make your decision.

16:43.752 --> 16:44.712
[chuckles]

16:47.923 --> 16:49.883
Will you step down of your own accord?

16:50.718 --> 16:53.345
Or do we need to drag you off of there
like a dog?

16:54.596 --> 16:56.640
So your father wasn't enough?

16:57.349 --> 17:00.894
You would murder
your mother and newborn brother?

17:04.314 --> 17:05.941
I welcome you to.

17:07.568 --> 17:09.194
I won't leave the throne.

17:09.820 --> 17:12.740
Try pulling if you must but I won't move!

17:17.828 --> 17:20.497
Your Highness does not need
to dirty his hands with her blood.

17:20.581 --> 17:21.832
Do not concern yourself.

17:21.915 --> 17:23.167
I will bring the seal

17:23.250 --> 17:26.045
and make her issue a royal edict
to announce your enthronement.

17:28.338 --> 17:30.132
[councilor 2] I will accompany him.

17:35.179 --> 17:36.263
[Queen sighs in amusement]

17:50.736 --> 17:52.571
It's the Second
and Third State Councilors.

17:52.654 --> 17:54.782
They're making their way here
for the royal seal.

17:55.365 --> 17:56.325
[sighs]

18:08.545 --> 18:11.131
[breathing heavily]

18:11.965 --> 18:13.967
[infected snarling]

18:22.226 --> 18:23.936
[panting]

18:28.190 --> 18:30.192
[ominous music]

18:35.906 --> 18:38.242
[hissing, snarling]

18:46.166 --> 18:48.836
- [lock clicking]
- [door opens]

18:48.919 --> 18:50.712
[snarling]

18:50.796 --> 18:52.214
- [court lady screams]
- [gasps]

18:53.632 --> 18:55.717
[court lady groans, splutters]

18:56.760 --> 18:57.928
[gasps]

19:00.639 --> 19:02.891
[distant screaming]

19:04.309 --> 19:06.478
[Seo-bi whimpering]

19:12.317 --> 19:13.735
Is anyone here?

19:16.488 --> 19:19.116
You're too fast, good sir.

19:19.366 --> 19:20.492
[grunts in annoyance]

19:21.034 --> 19:23.036
[ominous music]

19:24.746 --> 19:26.415
[Seo-bi groaning]

19:29.209 --> 19:30.294
[sighs]

19:36.175 --> 19:38.677
[breathing heavily]

19:43.307 --> 19:45.309
[tense music]

20:31.188 --> 20:35.400
[panicked shouting, screaming]

20:42.324 --> 20:43.533
[infected snarling]

20:47.371 --> 20:49.331
[women screaming]

20:53.877 --> 20:56.463
[growls]

21:02.678 --> 21:05.138
[snarling]

21:08.892 --> 21:10.394
[roars]

21:14.856 --> 21:17.067
[Third State Councillor]
Any news on the royal seal?

21:17.150 --> 21:19.152
- [Second State councilor yells in fright]
- [snarling]

21:19.236 --> 21:21.571
[Third State Councilor]
Councilor! Councilor!

21:22.447 --> 21:23.782
- Stay away!
- [snarling]

21:25.951 --> 21:28.829
- Get back! Oh! Oh, get back!
- [banging, crashing]

21:28.912 --> 21:31.081
I don't want to... I don't want to... Oh!

21:31.540 --> 21:33.500
I'm so sorry, I have to do this!

21:33.583 --> 21:34.918
[snarling]

21:36.336 --> 21:38.422
[Third State Councilor screaming]

21:45.345 --> 21:46.388
Stay away!

21:46.763 --> 21:48.265
Stay away! Stay away!

21:48.348 --> 21:49.683
[snarling]

21:51.184 --> 21:52.185
Open the door!

21:52.269 --> 21:53.437
Help! Open the door!

21:53.520 --> 21:54.354
[gasps]

21:55.022 --> 21:56.690
[Third State Councilor whimpering]

21:57.691 --> 21:58.692
Help!

21:58.775 --> 22:01.278
[screams]

22:02.904 --> 22:04.906
[distant screaming]

22:09.661 --> 22:10.746
[gasps]

22:12.622 --> 22:14.708
[clamoring in distance]

22:19.254 --> 22:21.715
[shouting, screaming in distance]

22:22.758 --> 22:23.759
You...

22:25.010 --> 22:26.887
What in God's name have you done?

22:28.889 --> 22:30.682
If the throne cannot be mine,

22:34.311 --> 22:35.687
well, then...

22:37.230 --> 22:38.982
no one can have it.

22:41.568 --> 22:42.944
[man screaming in distance]

22:51.119 --> 22:52.704
[screaming in distance]

22:56.541 --> 22:59.002
[in panic]
The plague is here!

23:00.420 --> 23:02.130
The plague is here!

23:06.051 --> 23:07.135
[baby coos]

23:08.470 --> 23:10.013
[Seo-bi] The plague is here!

23:15.352 --> 23:18.688
The plague is here.
It's spreading at the Queen's Palace.

23:20.232 --> 23:22.067
[woman screams in distance]

23:23.527 --> 23:25.737
[breathing anxiously]

23:27.447 --> 23:30.200
Shut and barricade
all the palace gates, now!

23:32.661 --> 23:35.038
HEUNGHWA GATE

23:35.122 --> 23:36.790
SUNGJEONG GATE

23:37.374 --> 23:39.418
My lord, what is happening?

23:39.501 --> 23:41.044
How did the sickness make it here?

23:41.128 --> 23:42.796
How they're here is not important.

23:42.879 --> 23:43.964
We have no time.

23:45.590 --> 23:47.634
Regardless if they're officers
or noblemen,

23:47.717 --> 23:49.010
you must destroy the head!

23:49.094 --> 23:50.762
Put an arrow between their eyes!

23:50.846 --> 23:54.516
Every single person
who has contracted this needs to die!

23:54.599 --> 23:55.559
Understood?

23:55.642 --> 23:56.476
[guards] Sir!

23:57.853 --> 23:59.062
Highness.

24:08.113 --> 24:10.282
[women screaming]

24:14.035 --> 24:16.121
[snarling]

24:31.178 --> 24:32.929
Don't let them bite you!

24:48.111 --> 24:50.572
[distant screaming]

24:54.201 --> 24:56.203
[woman screaming]

25:03.043 --> 25:05.045
- [shouting, screaming continues]
- [gasps]

25:21.686 --> 25:24.189
[screaming]

25:34.157 --> 25:36.284
We need to get you out of here!
Let's go! Hurry!

25:38.662 --> 25:39.871
[door clattering]

25:42.624 --> 25:43.833
Someone's in here.

25:47.045 --> 25:48.296
[groans]

25:49.714 --> 25:50.715
[sighs]

25:51.341 --> 25:52.968
I said someone's in here.

25:58.056 --> 26:00.267
[door splintering]

26:00.642 --> 26:02.686
[snarling]

26:04.062 --> 26:05.146
[whimpers]

26:18.285 --> 26:20.328
[stirring music]

27:15.550 --> 27:17.594
[gasping]

27:25.644 --> 27:27.312
- [infected snarling]
- [gasps]

27:34.319 --> 27:36.821
[stirring music]

27:44.079 --> 27:45.705
YEONGYEONG GATE

27:53.588 --> 27:56.049
Here. You take the portraits.

28:02.555 --> 28:03.598
[yells in fright]

28:04.516 --> 28:06.351
[infected snarling]

28:06.434 --> 28:07.560
[whimpering]

28:14.776 --> 28:16.820
[sorrowful music]

28:20.865 --> 28:21.741
[man screams]

28:22.409 --> 28:24.411
[menacing music]

28:27.622 --> 28:28.581
[shrieks]

28:59.195 --> 29:01.197
[shrieks]

29:10.999 --> 29:13.668
Is that it? Are they gone?

29:17.797 --> 29:18.673
[gasps]

29:18.757 --> 29:19.591
[silence]

29:21.968 --> 29:23.595
People aren't screaming.

29:24.804 --> 29:26.264
The screams have stopped.

29:30.602 --> 29:31.561
What's going on?

29:33.521 --> 29:35.648
Do you think they got it under control?

29:46.868 --> 29:48.244
[menacing music]

29:59.506 --> 30:01.216
Please! Please! You must go!

30:02.008 --> 30:03.927
Get out of here! Go!

30:04.260 --> 30:06.054
- [snarling, screeching]
- [groaning]

30:18.608 --> 30:20.568
There are too many.
They're breaking the gate!

30:24.030 --> 30:25.114
Sir, let's go!

30:26.908 --> 30:28.785
[Beom-pal whimpering]

31:04.153 --> 31:06.739
[crows cawing]

31:14.414 --> 31:15.331
[gasps in fright]

31:20.712 --> 31:22.463
[breathing anxiously]

31:35.393 --> 31:37.604
[thumping, banging]

31:43.818 --> 31:46.237
[panting]

31:51.284 --> 31:53.286
[closing theme music]
